comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T10:26:09.658Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Failure -> cause -> fix: bounded producer-contract I/O test expected invalid_contract for dialect false/42; GH-1665 (pm-cli CHANGELOG 2026.11.8) now coerces them to CLI path strings, so the documented refusal is io_error, exit 2. Retain those cases with the typed I/O matcher, replace malformed-option coverage with empty/blank path values, and run every guard case through BOTH native importer and extension command. Each refusal checks the real non-git tracker still contains no imported items. Null remains uncoerced by the public direct-call contract and must still refuse invalid_contract. Original focused suite: 8 pass, 1 fail; restoring original assertions reproduces the migration failure. No production changes or threshold changes."
  "2026-11-14T10:27:31.107Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Local validation passes: forecast suite 9/9, linked forecast test, npm/Bun typecheck, build:test, and docstrings (158 declarations). Production sources are unchanged. Full npm and Bun release gates are queued serially behind the existing fleet gate to respect the shared-host limit; CI also certifies the unchanged 100% line/branch/function thresholds. No standalone lint script is declared."
